{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f30b0fa9f282556b7f5f56d224f41ba9.avif?t=1742499588\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;YUKOMON - An Indie Dream with a Greater Purpose&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In YUKOMON, your mission is to save Juju, a little girl turned into a monster after an accident. Capture 200 unique Yukomons and face Team T, a dark force dreaming of a monster-only world, using the Yukotrix \u2014 an ancient artifact full of secrets. Crafted by a solo developer, this RPG is more than a game: it\u2019s a personal effort to support my family through tough times.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6a79342fcff8686a2050d2ae5626b72.poster.avif?t=1742499588\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6a79342fcff8686a2050d2ae5626b72.webm?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6a79342fcff8686a2050d2ae5626b72.mp4?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why play?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ hand-drawn monsters: No duplicates, evolve your favorites with genetic bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique battles: Cheer for your Yukomon to grant buffs and turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ vibrant maps: Explore with skate, kayak, fishing, and farming, under dynamic day, night, and weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartfelt story: Protect Juju and defeat Team T from the DeChamps Corporation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode: Become the villain with absolute power \u2014 but the hero shines brighter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6f4749f021621cbdfeac6445ed1a717.poster.avif?t=1742499588\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6f4749f021621cbdfeac6445ed1a717.webm?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6f4749f021621cbdfeac6445ed1a717.mp4?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;With retro art, a Yukopedia, and partial translations (English, Portuguese, Chinese, Russian, Japanese \u2014 names in English for aesthetics), YUKOMON is an indie with soul. Every purchase helps make a difference for me and those I love.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6687bf3c3afe3320d7c8144901dad47.poster.avif?t=1742499588\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6687bf3c3afe3320d7c8144901dad47.webm?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6687bf3c3afe3320d7c8144901dad47.mp4?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;YUKOMON brings a unique and innovative PET battle system: now the trainer actively joins the fight, CHEERING for their Yukomon, granting BUFFS to their partner as a boost to battle.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In the interface, we took the liberty of partially translating, keeping ability names, characters, Yukomons, and places in English for aesthetics, so it\u2019s not listed as fully translated on Steam.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/42a33f64fa028dfb14b73e95b396ae8d.avif?t=1742499588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras_big/42a33f64fa028dfb14b73e95b396ae8d.avif?t=1742499588 width=800 height=258 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"JUJU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/668b4cbd96449ba5c12300e24d795c83b8cab24b.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/07b56e6139008c20e9894ee01c428a5c4ad7e98e.jpg"},{"name":"Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/74f49471cb03217864920ddb14d202de03ef5f72.jpg"},{"name":"Magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/a0835b32637ae0e00f99cfe514b083f01527333c.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Miko","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/ef69e8761b061450d9d46957585c6866a5ce172f.jpg"},{"name":"SKATE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/8572edc507a389b3f9eda29aeea86e0aa8be36ef.jpg"},{"name":"Surf? NO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/c9b89de753e22289a586d8f2e4a1529551a0dbbd.jpg"},{"name":"Protector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/41e0e59c2f804bab4832d505058b3c5ce8dc574a.jpg"},{"name":"Brainwashing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/01687abba838c753bf8a7a9075309eca9876e608.jpg"},{"name":"Final Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537730/e8260adc44107caf673b392cfe1a1a9d8fb735da.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537730?t=1742499588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537730?t=1742499588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/04b5a4c311933929bc88c04ebde170417dd0d505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742499588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/04b5a4c311933929bc88c04ebde170417dd0d505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742499588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f30b0fa9f282556b7f5f56d224f41ba9.avif?t=1742499588\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;YUKOMON - An Indie Dream with a Greater Purpose&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In YUKOMON, your mission is to save Juju, a little girl turned into a monster after an accident. Capture 200 unique Yukomons and face Team T, a dark force dreaming of a monster-only world, using the Yukotrix \u2014 an ancient artifact full of secrets. Crafted by a solo developer, this RPG is more than a game: it\u2019s a personal effort to support my family through tough times.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6a79342fcff8686a2050d2ae5626b72.poster.avif?t=1742499588\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6a79342fcff8686a2050d2ae5626b72.webm?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6a79342fcff8686a2050d2ae5626b72.mp4?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why play?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ hand-drawn monsters: No duplicates, evolve your favorites with genetic bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique battles: Cheer for your Yukomon to grant buffs and turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ vibrant maps: Explore with skate, kayak, fishing, and farming, under dynamic day, night, and weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartfelt story: Protect Juju and defeat Team T from the DeChamps Corporation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode: Become the villain with absolute power \u2014 but the hero shines brighter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6f4749f021621cbdfeac6445ed1a717.poster.avif?t=1742499588\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6f4749f021621cbdfeac6445ed1a717.webm?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6f4749f021621cbdfeac6445ed1a717.mp4?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;With retro art, a Yukopedia, and partial translations (English, Portuguese, Chinese, Russian, Japanese \u2014 names in English for aesthetics), YUKOMON is an indie with soul. Every purchase helps make a difference for me and those I love.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6687bf3c3afe3320d7c8144901dad47.poster.avif?t=1742499588\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6687bf3c3afe3320d7c8144901dad47.webm?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/f6687bf3c3afe3320d7c8144901dad47.mp4?t=1742499588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;YUKOMON brings a unique and innovative PET battle system: now the trainer actively joins the fight, CHEERING for their Yukomon, granting BUFFS to their partner as a boost to battle.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In the interface, we took the liberty of partially translating, keeping ability names, characters, Yukomons, and places in English for aesthetics, so it\u2019s not listed as fully translated on Steam.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras/42a33f64fa028dfb14b73e95b396ae8d.avif?t=1742499588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/extras_big/42a33f64fa028dfb14b73e95b396ae8d.avif?t=1742499588 width=800 height=258 /></span></p>","developers":["Hoffnung Haydn"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/header.jpg?t=1742499588","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537730/829656/4ab8b824553df154c7a7e6b67eb55755363cad3c/1750859064/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740692062","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537730/829656/4ab8b824553df154c7a7e6b67eb55755363cad3c/1750859064/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740692062","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537730/829656/4ab8b824553df154c7a7e6b67eb55755363cad3c/1750859064/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740692062","id":257098805,"name":"video base","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098805/0dd0f98e08cd9ea84cdaf973b0d0b04ab50a1599/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740692062"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537730/841829/ad79a8a481ef66f053545841acc4c7d6653ddbbb/17