a123.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742499588","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537730/157fd3495617a1ec29287ae659580bd6d5bea123/ss_157fd3495617a1ec29287ae659580bd6d5bea123.600x338.jpg?t=1742499588"}],"short_description":"The protagonist's life changes when their 5-year-old sister is transformed into a Yukomon. The only cure is to complete the genetic search for the 200 cataloged Yukomons, but Team T is ready to sabotage their journey.","steam_appid":3537730,"support_info":{"email":"gantz22gtxz@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DZlaQgnYMOY"}